      "hints": [
        "I need to blink, so some seconds must be dim and some bright. Dim is 0.3 or less, and bright is 0.7 or more. Which seconds should be dim?",
        "Think of the seconds in pairs: 0 and 1, then 2 and 3, then 4 and 5. Each pair has a first second and a second second. How can your function tell them apart?",
